      "@id": "gh:scenePrompt/07_Resolution",
      "sceneId": "scene:07_Resolution",
      "promptEn": "[Camera] Medium wide shot, eye-level angle, 50mm normal lens. 16:9 aspect ratio. Deep focus composition showing all characters clearly. Slightly elevated angle (looking down at 5-degree angle) to show triangular composition. [Lighting] Soft, gentle lighting indicating resolution. Key light: warm window light (4000K) from office windows, soft and diffused, coming from upper left. Intensity: medium, creating gentle illumination. Fill light: restored monitor screens emitting soft blue-white glow (6000K) at 40% intensity, providing ambient fill. Rim light: subtle warm edge (3500K) on characters from window light. Backlighting: soft warm glow (3800K) from behind, creating gentle rim on characters' edges. Color temperature: warm tones dominate (3500-4000K), creating peaceful atmosphere. Shadows: soft, minimal, low contrast. [Background] Same construction company office, now calm and restored. Papers: scattered documents and blueprints now settled on desks and floor, no longer animated. Cables: LAN cables lying flat on floor, no longer writhing, organized or coiled. Office furniture: desks and chairs in normal positions, some slightly displaced from battle but stable. Monitors: multiple PC monitors showing restored desktop backgrounds - familiar Windows/Mac desktops, business software interfaces, normal operation. Soft glow from screens provides ambient light. Walls: same beige/gray walls, possibly with some scuff marks or minor damage from battle, but overall intact. Atmosphere: quiet, peaceful, post-storm calm. [Characters] Triangular composition in center: Goro Daimon (CEO, 62 years old): Standing, positioned at apex of triangle (center-back). Wearing: work clothes - construction site attire, possibly safety vest, work pants, boots, company cap. Face: shocked and confused expression, eyes wide, mouth slightly open, eyebrows raised. Body language: standing straight, one hand possibly on hip or adjusting cap. Expression: concerned, trying to understand situation. Shouta (26 years old): Standing, positioned at left point of triangle. Wearing: business suit (same as before), slightly disheveled from events, tie still loosened. Face: firm resolve, determined expression, eyes focused, mouth set. Body language: standing straight, shoulders back, arms at sides or one hand in pocket. Expression: mature, responsible, showing growth. Yasumoto (52 years old): Sitting collapsed on floor, positioned at right point of triangle. Wearing: business suit, completely disheveled - jacket removed or torn, shirt untucked, tie missing. Face: head bowed, face hidden or partially visible showing despair, eyes closed or downcast, mouth trembling. Body language: sitting on floor, legs folded or extended, one hand covering face or supporting head, other hand on floor. Expression: defeated, regretful, broken. Other employees: Matsuda, Sato, and others visible in background, standing or seated at desks. Expressions: relief, exhaustion, concern. Body language: various relaxed postures, some checking monitors, some talking quietly. [Composition] Triangular composition with three main characters forming points. Goro at apex (center-back, standing), Shouta at left point (standing), Yasumoto at right point (sitting). Deep focus shows all elements clearly. Leading lines from desk edges and monitor cables guide eye to triangle. Balanced composition with visual weight distributed. Background monitors create depth layers. [Mood] Relief from tension, hint of sorrow, forward-looking resolve. Peaceful resolution. Sense of closure and new beginning. Emotional complexity - not purely happy or sad, but nuanced. [Style] Anime movie epilogue style. Soft, gentle lighting. Clean line art, naturalistic coloring with warm tones. Emphasis on emotional expression and body language. Realistic material textures. Cinematic quality, contemplative pace.",
      "panels": [
        {
          "@id": "gh:panelPrompt/p14-2",
          "pageId": "page:14",
          "panelIndex": 2,
